    "body": "After seeing [this](https://github.com/neovim/neovim/pull/32965), a few months have passed.\r\n\r\nWondering if, based on the parser progress (if any), we're comfortable with enabling C or vimscript parsers by default now..\r\n\r\nHappy to run some profiling - but more curious how things have evolved since it's been 6 months.",
    "closed_at": "2026-10-17T22:08:03Z",
    "comment_data": [],
    "comment_regular_data": [
        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Sorry, but all the previous reasons against still stand. And it's a one-line opt-in, while opting out (without side effects) is much more involved.",
